  m_text: "\tYou traversed these halls for far too long.\r\n\tYou try to lift your
    foot off the ground but it proved to be too much for you. The room becomes dark
    and in the shadows you start to see them. \r\n\tThe room is starting to fill
    with people. Who are they and why are they appearing here now?\r\n\t\u2026No,
    they were always here, just hidden. \r\n\tThe last thing you remember is you
    collapsing on the floor."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6553708be1b72da4fa48cef9bfc77405, type: 2}
